The ReSTIR story's weighted reservoir sampling
==============================================

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

Weighted reservoir sampling at one pixel

What the story draws on the canvas while P's candidates stream through a reservoir (chapter 2, beat `c2-wrs-stream`),
stage by stage as its stage (`stepOf "wrs" 21`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 17: the eight candidates as cards on a stream (a tape, at first), the
reservoir's record of three things, each candidate joining it (its weight into the sum, then its chance to
replace the kept one, against the number the update drew), the chance each ends kept, and the merge with a second
reservoir. The numbers are the math scenes' example world's (examples.rs, the lab's illustration), its stream run
through the lab's reservoir (the natives `exampleTrace`, `exampleMerge`).


The example stream's numbers (the seed of its draws and its updates).
$[# _seed 10]

The stream's cards, along the top.
$[# _cardY 2.3]
Fn([Int, Int], Vec2). Card i's centre, of `n` in the row.
$[# {_cardAt i n} {v2 {* 1.6 {- {float i} {/ {float {- n 1}} 2.0}}} _cardY}]
Fn([Int], Float). The stage at which candidate i reaches the reservoir: the first at 6, the second at 7, the rest one
a stage from 9.
$[# {_joins i} {!if {= i 0} 6.0 {!if {= i 1} 7.0 {+ 9.0 {float {- i 2}}}}}]
Fn([Int], Float). The stage by which candidate i's weight is in the sum.
$[# {_joined i} {!if {< i 2} {+ {_joins i} 1.0} {+ {_joins i} 0.3}}]
Fn([Int], List(Float)). When candidate i's chance is weighed against its number: from, to (the first is kept as it
joins; from the third on, half a stage from when its weight is in the sum, so its name has time to fly).
$[# {_decides i} {!if {= i 0}
    {' 6.0 7.0}
    {!if {= i 1} {' 8.0 9.0} {' {+ {_joins i} 0.3} {+ {_joins i} 0.8}}}}]

Fn([Int], Float). When candidate i's verdict is in the record: a replacing name has flown there (most of the way
through its chance for the first two; for the rest, just before the next candidate joins).
$[# {_lands i} {!if {< i 2}
    {lerp {nth {_decides i} 0} {nth {_decides i} 1} 0.8}
    {+ {_joins i} 0.9}}]

Fn([Vec2], List(Mob)). The highlight behind the card at `at`, named for its card.
$[# {_cardLit id at} {filled id
    {box {sub2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}}}
    targetColor
    0.25}]
Fn([Int, Int, List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float})], List(Mob)). Card i:
x_i and its weight.
$[# {_card i n steps}
    [# at {_cardAt i n}]
    {flatten {'
        {outlined f"{card${str i}}"
            {box {sub2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}}}
            textDimColor
            2.0}
        {moveTo
            {tex f"{cardName${str i}}" f"{x_{${str {+ i 1}}}}" 0.42 textColor}
            {add2 at {v2 0.0 0.2}}}
        {moveTo
            {tex f"{w${str i}}" {short {.w {nth steps i}}} 0.34 weightColor}
            {sub2 at {v2 0.0 0.22}}}}}]
Fn([List(Mob)], Fn([Float, List(Mob)], List(Mob))). A figure risen from `source`: `source` fading in where it is
over the first quarter, then a copy of it flying into the figure's place and turning into it (a reservoir becoming
a fresh candidate).
$[# {_risen source} {^ {t f} {!if {< t 0.25}
    {faded source {smooth {phase t 0.0 0.25}}}
    {fromCopy {phase t 0.25 1.0} source f}}}]
A card sliding in from the right as it fades in.
$[# _slidIn [% {: {^ {t f} {fadeIn t {shift f {v2
    {* 1.5 {- 1.0 {smooth t}}}
    0.0}}}} {Fn {' Float {List Mob}} {List Mob}}}]]

The tape

Fn([], List(Mob)). Two reels and the tape between them.
$[# {_tape}
    [# {_reel x} {pathThrough "reel"
        {map
            {range 0 33}
            {^ {k}
                [# a {* {/ {float k} 32.0} {* 2.0 pi}}]
                {v2 {+ x {* 0.55 {cos a}}} {+ _cardY {* 0.55 {sin a}}}}}}
        textDimColor
        2.5}]
    {flatten {'
        {_reel -6.6}
        {_reel 6.6}
        {line "tapeTop" {v2 -6.6 {+ _cardY 0.55}} {v2 6.6 {+ _cardY 0.55}} textDimColor 2.0}
        {line "tapeBottom" {v2 -6.6 {- _cardY 0.55}} {v2 6.6 {- _cardY 0.55}} textDimColor 2.0}}}]
Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The read head at stage s, passing once along the tape in stage 3.
$[# {_head s}
    [# x {lerp -5.6 5.6 {smooth {phase s 2.0 3.0}}}]
    {arrowLine "head" {v2 x {- _cardY 1.3}} {v2 x {- _cardY 0.65}} accentColor 3.0}]
Fn([], List(Mob)). The stream's arrow and its words, where the tape was.
$[# {_stream} {append
    {arrowLine "stream" {v2 -6.6 {+ _cardY 0.75}} {v2 6.6 {+ _cardY 0.75}} textDimColor 2.0}
    {moveTo
        {caption "streamText" {textKey "wrsmath-stream"} 0.34 textDimColor}
        {v2 0.0 {+ _cardY 1.05}}}}]

The reservoir's records

The first reservoir's record, as the stream leaves it.
$[# _recordPlace [% {v2 -2.6 -1.0}]]
Fn([Int], Vec2). Where field k of a record at `at` is.
$[# {_fieldAt at k} {add2 at {v2 {nth {' -1.8 0.0 1.8} k} 0.0}}]
Fn([String, Vec2], List(Mob)). A record's frame at `at`: its box, the rules between its fields, and their captions
(the kept candidate, the sum of weights, the count), named under `id`.
$[# {_recordFrame id at}
    [# {_caption k cap} {moveTo cap {add2 {_fieldAt at k} {v2 0.0 0.85}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {outlined {++ id "Box"} {box {sub2 at {v2 2.7 0.55}} {add2 at {v2 2.7 0.55}}} textColor 2.5}
        {line {++ id "Rule"} {add2 at {v2 -0.9 -0.55}} {add2 at {v2 -0.9 0.55}} textDimColor 1.5}
        {line {++ id "Rule"} {add2 at {v2 0.9 -0.55}} {add2 at {v2 0.9 0.55}} textDimColor 1.5}
        {_caption 0 {caption {++ id "Cap0"} {textKey "wrsmath-kept"} 0.32 textDimColor}}
        {_caption 1 {caption {++ id "Cap1"} {textKey "wrsmath-sum"} 0.32 textDimColor}}
        {_caption 2 {caption {++ id "Cap2"} {textKey "wrsmath-count"} 0.32 textDimColor}}}}]
Fn([String, Vec2, Int, String], List(Mob)). Field k of the record `id` at `at`, showing `value` (LaTeX).
$[# {_field id at k value} {moveTo
    {tex {++ id {++ "F" {str k}}} value 0.44 textColor}
    {_fieldAt at k}}]
Fn([String, Vec2, String, String, String], List(Mob)). A whole record: its frame and its three fields.
$[# {_record id at kept sum count} {flatten {'
    {_recordFrame id at}
    {_field id at 0 kept}
    {_field id at 1 sum}
    {_field id at 2 count}}}]

Merging two reservoirs

Section 3.2's merge (148:5): each reservoir's kept candidate is fed to a new reservoir as a fresh candidate whose
weight is that reservoir's whole sum of weights; the new count is the counts added (Alg. 4). Stages 16 to 21: the
first stream gives way, P's next eight candidates' reservoir appears beside the first, each reservoir becomes a
fresh candidate, a new reservoir takes them in turn (the second's chance its sum over both), the counts add, and the
new reservoir is all that is kept.

Fn([String, Vec2, Int, Float], List(Mob)). A fresh candidate: a reservoir's kept one, weighing its whole sum.
$[# {_freshCard id at kept w} {flatten {'
    {outlined {++ id "Box"} {box {sub2 at {v2 0.8 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.8 0.5}}} targetColor 2.5}
    {moveTo {tex {++ id "Name"} {keptName kept} 0.42 textColor} {add2 at {v2 0.0 0.2}}}
    {moveTo {tex {++ id "W"} {short w} 0.34 weightColor} {sub2 at {v2 0.0 0.22}}}}}]

The scene

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), {kept: Int, split: Int, u: Float}], Score).
The stream through a reservoir as a score of 21 steps: the stream as a tape, its cards, the reservoir's record
filled as each candidate joins and weighs its chance (one view of the chance, kept up from the second candidate
to the last: the second's weighing shown as it happens, then each later one's result turning into the next's), each
candidate's final chance, and the merge of two reservoirs into one.
$[# {_score steps merge}
    [# n {length steps}]
    [# split {.split merge}]
    [# last {nth steps {- split 1}}]
    [# placeA {v2 -3.6 2.4}]
    [# placeB {v2 3.6 2.4}]
    [# placeC {v2 -2.8 -1.4}]
    [# {_place s} {lerp2 _recordPlace placeA {smooth {phase s 16.0 16.6}}}]
    [# {_dim s} {- 1.0 {* 0.55 {smooth {phase s 20.0 20.5}}}}]
    [# {_still fig} {^ {s} fig}]
    [# {_sumAt s}
        [# joined {filter {range 0 split} {^ {i} {>= s {_joins i}}}}]
        [# at {!if {isEmpty joined} 0 {nth joined {- {length joined} 1}}}]
        [# before {!if {< at 1} 0.0 {.wsum {nth steps {- at 1}}}}]
        {lerp before {.wsum {nth steps at}} {smooth {phase s {_joins at} {_joined at}}}}]
    [# {_countAt s} {length {filter {range 0 split} {^ {i} {>= s {_joins i}}}}}]
    [# {_inA k value} {^ {s} {faded {_field "A" {_place s} k {value s}} {_dim s}}}]
    [# keptFirst {.kept {nth steps 0}}]
    [# taken {filter {range 1 split} {^ {i} {.taken {nth steps i}}}}]
    [# {_cardParts i}
        [# d {_decides i}]
        [# shown {_card i split steps}]
        {'
            {part f"{card${str i}}"
                {^ {s} {faded shown {lerp 1.0 0.45 {smooth {phase s {nth d 1} {+ {nth d 1} 0.3}}}}}}
                {'
                    {enterOver {* 0.1 {float i}} 0.25 _slidIn}
                    {emphasize 15.6 16.0 {^ {t f} {!if {= i {.kept last}}
                        {circumscribe t f targetColor}
                        f}}}
                    {exitOver 16.0 0.4 fadeOut}}}
            {part f"{lit${str i}}"
                {_still {_cardLit f"{lit${str i}}" {_cardAt i split}}}
                {' {enterOver {_joins i} 0.15 create} {exitOver {nth d 1} 0.2 fadeOut}}}}]
    [# {_view i} {^ {s}
        [# d {_decides i}]
        [# step {nth steps i}]
        {chanceView f"{\frac{w_{${str {+ i 1}}}}{w_{\text{sum}}}}"
            {.w step}
            {.wsum step}
            {.u step}
            {.taken step}
            {!if {= i 1} {phase s {nth d 0} {nth d 1}} 1.0}
            {v2 4.4 -0.2}}}]
    [# chancePart {part "chance"
        {_view 1}
        {append
            {cons
                {enterOver 8.0 0.2 fadeIn}
                {map {range 2 split} {^ {i} {becomeOver {nth {_decides i} 0} 0.6 {_view i}}}}}
            {' {exitOver 15.0 0.3 fadeOut}}}}]
    [# {_flyParts i}
        [# d {_decides i}]
        [# from {!if {< i 2} {lerp {nth d 0} {nth d 1} 0.5} {+ {_joins i} 0.6}}]
        [# name {moveTo
            {tex f"{fly${str i}}" {keptName i} 0.44 textColor}
            {_fieldAt _recordPlace 0}}]
        [# source {moveTo
            {tex f"{flySource${str i}}" {keptName i} 0.42 textColor}
            {add2 {_cardAt i split} {v2 0.0 0.2}}}]
        {'
            {part f"{fly${str i}}"
                {_still name}
                {'
                    {enterOver from {max 0.1 {- {_lands i} from}} {^ {t f} {fromCopy t source f}}}
                    {exitOver {_lands i} {!if {< i 2} 0.2 0.1} fadeOut}}}}]
    [# {_bar i}
        [# c {over {.w {nth steps i}} {.wsum last}}]
        [# at {_cardAt i split}]
        [# bar {filled f"{chanceBar${str i}}"
            {box {v2 {- {.x at} 0.3} 0.4} {v2 {+ {.x at} 0.3} {+ 0.4 {* 1.2 c}}}}
            estimateColor
            0.85}]
        {'
            {part f"{chanceBar${str i}}"
                {_still bar}
                {' {enterOver {+ 15.0 {* 0.05 {float i}}} 0.5 growUp} {exitOver 16.0 0.4 fadeOut}}}
            {part f"{chance${str i}Label}"
                {_still {nextTo
                    {tex f"{chance${str i}}" {numberLatex c 2} 0.32 estimateColor}
                    bar
                    up
                    0.08}}
                {' {enterOver 15.4 0.4 fadeIn} {exitOver 16.0 0.4 fadeOut}}}}]
    [# keptField {!if {isEmpty taken}
        {' {enterOver {- {_lands 0} 0.1} 0.12 fadeIn}}
        {cons
            {enterOver {- {_lands 0} 0.1} 0.12 fadeIn}
            {map taken {^ {i}
                [# d {_decides i}]
                [# from {lerp {nth d 0} {nth d 1} 0.5}]
                {becomeOver from {- {+ {_lands i} 0.05} from} {_inA 0 {^ {s} {keptName i}}}}}}}}]
    [# total {+ {.wsum last} {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}}]
    [# keptB {.kept {nth steps {- n 1}}}]
    [# takenB {!and {>= keptB 0} {< {* {.u merge} total} {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}}}]
    [# freshA {_freshCard "freshA" {v2 -1.4 0.7} {.kept last} {.wsum last}}]
    [# freshB {_freshCard "freshB" {v2 1.4 0.7} keptB {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}}]
    [# {_cSum s} {!if {< s 18.45}
        {* {.wsum last} {smooth {phase s 18.2 18.4}}}
        {lerp {.wsum last} total {smooth {phase s 18.45 18.55}}}}]
    [# {_flyC id name at length} {part id
        {_still {moveTo {tex "flyC" {keptName name} 0.44 textColor} {_fieldAt placeC 0}}}
        {'
            {enterOver at length {^ {t f} {fromCopy t
                {withId
                    {!if {= id "flyCA"} freshA freshB}
                    {!if {= id "flyCA"} "freshAName" "freshBName"}}
                f}}}
            {exitOver {+ at length} 0.1 fadeOut}}}]
    [# {_cField k value} {_still {_field "C" placeC k value}}]
    {score "wrs" 21
        {flatten {'
            {'
                {part "tape"
                    {_still {_tape}}
                    {' {enterOver 1.0 0.6 create} {exitOver 3.0 0.5 fadeOut}}}
                {part "head" _head {' {enterOver 2.0 0.15 fadeIn} {exitOver 3.0 0.2 fadeOut}}}
                {part "stream"
                    {_still {_stream}}
                    {' {enterOver 3.3 0.7 fadeIn} {exitOver 16.0 0.4 fadeOut}}}
                {part "recordA"
                    {^ {s} {faded {_recordFrame "A" {_place s}} {_dim s}}}
                    {'
                        {enterOver 4.0 0.8 write}
                        {emphasize 5.0 6.0 {^ {t f} {circumscribe t f targetColor}}}}}
                {part "AF0" {_inA 0 {^ {s} {keptName keptFirst}}} keptField}
                {part "AF1" {_inA 1 {^ {s} {short {_sumAt s}}}} {' {enterOver 6.0 0.2 fadeIn}}}
                {part "AF2" {_inA 2 {^ {s} {str {_countAt s}}}} {' {enterOver 6.0 0.2 fadeIn}}}}
            {flatten {map {range 0 split} _cardParts}}
            {' chancePart}
            {flatten {map {filter {range 0 split} {^ {i} {.taken {nth steps i}}}} _flyParts}}
            {flatten {map {range 0 split} _bar}}
            {'
                {part "recordB"
                    {^ {s} {faded
                        {append
                            {_record "B" placeB
                                {keptName keptB}
                                {short {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}}
                                {str {- n split}}}
                            {moveTo
                                {caption "nextText" {textKey "wrsmath-next"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                                {add2 placeB {v2 0.0 1.4}}}}
                        {_dim s}}}
                    {' {enterOver 16.4 0.6 fadeIn}}}
                {part "freshA"
                    {_still freshA}
                    {'
                        {enterOver 17.0 0.6 {_risen {_freshCard "freshA"
                            {add2 placeA {v2 -1.8 0.0}}
                            {.kept last}
                            {.wsum last}}}}
                        {exitOver 18.2 0.3 fadeOut}}}
                {part "freshB"
                    {_still freshB}
                    {'
                        {enterOver 17.4 0.6 {_risen {_freshCard "freshB"
                            {add2 placeB {v2 -1.8 0.0}}
                            keptB
                            {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}}}}
                        {exitOver 18.85 0.15 fadeOut}}}
                {part "recordC"
                    {_still {_recordFrame "C" placeC}}
                    {'
                        {enterOver 17.6 0.4 write}
                        {emphasize 20.0 21.0 {^ {t f} {circumscribe t f targetColor}}}}}
                {part "CF0"
                    {_cField 0 {keptName {.kept last}}}
                    {!if takenB
                        {'
                            {enterOver 18.4 0.1 fadeIn}
                            {becomeOver 18.75 0.25 {_cField 0 {keptName {.kept merge}}}}}
                        {' {enterOver 18.4 0.1 fadeIn}}}}
                {part "CF1"
                    {^ {s} {_field "C" placeC 1 {short {_cSum s}}}}
                    {' {enterOver 18.2 0.2 fadeIn}}}
                {part "CF2"
                    {_cField 2 f"{${str split} + ${str {- n split}}}"}
                    {' {enterOver 19.0 0.2 fadeIn} {becomeOver 19.5 0.5 {_cField 2 {str n}}}}}
                {_flyC "flyCA" {.kept last} 18.2 0.3}
                {part "mergeChance"
                    {^ {s} {chanceView f"{\frac{w^B_{\text{sum}}}{w^A_{\text{sum}} + w^B_{\text{sum}}}}"
                        {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}
                        total
                        {.u merge}
                        takenB
                        {phase s 18.5 18.95}
                        {v2 3.6 -0.9}}}
                    {' {enterOver 18.5 0.1 fadeIn} {exitOver 18.9 0.1 fadeOut}}}}
            {!if takenB {' {_flyC "flyCB" keptB 18.75 0.25}} {'}}}}
        {'}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The stream through a reservoir at stage its stage (`stepOf "wrs" 21`, the clips below).
$[# wrsMath {: {^ {t} {playScore {_score {exampleTrace _seed 16} {exampleMerge _seed 16}}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each;
the story plays each over its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
$[# wrsSteps [% {stepsInOrder "wrs" 21}]]
$[# wrsAt0 [% {stepsAt "wrs" 21 0}]]
$[# wrsRun992To1500 [% {stepsRun "wrs" 9.92 15.0}]]
